  1929       perform  forever
  1930                accept   WS-Env-Lines   from lines
  1931                if       WS-Env-Lines < 28
  1932                         display  SY010    at 0101 with erase eos
  1933                         accept   WS-Reply at 0133
  1934                         exit perform cycle
  1935                else
  1936                         display space at 0101 erase eos
  1937                end-if
  1938                accept   WS-Env-Columns from Columns
  1939                if       WS-Env-Columns < 80
