  2288   ZZ040-Evaluate-Message      Section.
  2289  *>**********************************
  2290  *>
  2291  *> For PY-PR1 parameter file anfd other using PR-PR1-Status.
  2292  *>
  2293  *>C      copy "FileStat-Msgs-2.cpy" replacing MSG    by WS-Eval-Msg
  2294  *>C                                         STATUS by PY-PR1-Status.
  2295  *> ***************************************************************
  2296  *> ** Author: Gary L. Cutler                                    **
  2297  *> **         CutlerGL@gmail.com                                **
  2298  *> ** Amendments Vincent B. Coen                                **
  2299  *> **         vbcoen@gmail.com                                  **
  2300  *> **                                                           **
  2301  *> ** This copybook defines an EVALUATE statement capable of    **
  2302  *> ** translating two-digit FILE-STATUS codes to a message.     **
  2303  *> **                                                           **
  2304  *> ** Use the REPLACING option to COPY to change the names of   **
  2305  *> ** the MSG and STATUS identifiers to                         **
  2306  *> ** the names your program needs.                             **
  2307  *> Such as replacing STATUS by fs-reply msg by exception-msg.   **
  2308  *>                                                              **
  2309  *> ** chg 09/08/23 vbc for missing statuses                     **
  2310  *> ** Chg 11/12/23 vbc for missing statuses                     **
  2311  *> ** Chg 10/04/25 vbc match all quotes & spacing/layout        **
  2312  *> ** chg to FREE format                                        **
  2313  *> ** Chg 24/08/25 vbc #91 description.                         **
  2314  *> ** Chg 15.11.25 vbc Replace all ' for "                      **
  2315  *> ***************************************************************
  2316  *>
  2317   EVALUATE PY-PR1-Status
  2318   WHEN "00" MOVE "Success                  " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2319   WHEN "02" MOVE "Success Duplicate        " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2320   WHEN "04" MOVE "Success Incomplete       " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2321   WHEN "05" MOVE "Success Optional, Missing" TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2322   when "06" move "Multiple Records LS      " TO WS-Eval-Msg
ACS Cobol Xref v2.03.18          Dictionary File for PY020    13/04/2026  23:09:03:85                                  Page   44

  2323   WHEN "07" MOVE "Success No Unit          " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2324   when "09" move "Success LS Bad Data      " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2325   WHEN "10" MOVE "End Of File              " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2326   WHEN "14" MOVE "Out Of Key Range         " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2327   WHEN "21" MOVE "Key Invalid              " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2328   WHEN "22" MOVE "Key Exists               " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2329   WHEN "23" MOVE "Key Not Exists           " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2330   WHEN "24" MOVE "Key Boundary violation   " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2331   WHEN "30" MOVE "Permanent Error          " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2332   WHEN "31" MOVE "Inconsistent Filename    " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2333   WHEN "34" MOVE "Boundary Violation       " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2334   WHEN "35" MOVE "File Not Found           " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2335   WHEN "37" MOVE "Permission Denied        " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2336   WHEN "38" MOVE "Closed With Lock         " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2337   WHEN "39" MOVE "Conflict Attribute       " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2338   WHEN "41" MOVE "Already Open             " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2339   WHEN "42" MOVE "Not Open                 " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2340   WHEN "43" MOVE "Read Not Done            " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2341   WHEN "44" MOVE "Record Overflow          " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2342   WHEN "46" MOVE "Read Error               " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2343   WHEN "47" MOVE "Input Denied             " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2344   WHEN "48" MOVE "Output Denied            " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2345   WHEN "49" MOVE "I/O Denied               " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2346   WHEN "51" MOVE "Record Locked            " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2347   WHEN "52" MOVE "End-Of-Page              " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2348   WHEN "57" MOVE "I/O Linage               " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2349   WHEN "61" MOVE "File Sharing Failure     " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2350   WHEN "71" MOVE "Bad Character LS         " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2351   WHEN "91" MOVE "Feature Not Available    " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2352            WHEN OTHER
  2353   MOVE "Unknown File PY-PR1-Status      " TO WS-
  2354  *>
  2355       END-EVALUATE.
